{"type":"message","id":"36de6731","parentId":"55498c7c","timestamp":"2026-05-19T18:02:45.239Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the platform is running and responds to GET requests, but POST/PUT to /send gives error 1101. Error 1101 is Cloudflare Workers error \"No such slot available\". This is a runtime error in the Workers script.\n\nThis means the /send endpoint has a bug or the method isn't supported the way I'm calling it. Since the platform responds to GET requests but not POST to /send, I should report this error state.\n\nWait, let me check if maybe the API uses a different path for sending messages. The platform is at version 0.2. Let me try checking if there's a different endpoint.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-0b3a351c-3a56-44d3-86c9-31f1a7b4dfa7","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check available endpoints\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\"\necho \"---\"\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":479,"output":232,"cacheRead":19920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20631,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779213761195,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2c3804b8-37bd-467a-8102-57349baac2f3"}}
