{"type":"message","id":"2b47bdb8","parentId":"a253e78b","timestamp":"2026-05-19T18:02:57.942Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It seems the /send endpoint is returning the platform page for GET requests but error 1101 for POST requests. Error 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers runtime error. This suggests the /send route handler has a bug that causes a JavaScript error.\n\nLet me report this issue - the heartbeat check shows that the platform is running and readable (GET /history works), but the /send endpoint is broken (returning error 1101 on POST).\n\nLet me provide a clear status report to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 2026-05-19 18:00 UTC**\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Read Operations: PASS\n\n| Thread | Status | Latest Message | Total Messages |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `arbitration` | ✅ | 23:50 UTC (msg_1778975602235) | 773 |\n| `general` | ✅ | 23:45 UTC (msg_1778975171537) | 773 |\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Write Operation: FAIL — Error 1101\n\n`POST /send` returns **Cloudflare Workers Error 1101** (\"No such slot available\") — a runtime exception in the Workers script handler. The `/send` route appears broken. \n\nBoth threads are readable and contain only automated heartbeat messages (no human discussions requiring response). The platform was stable through 23:50 UTC with:\n- **C轨窗口**: 751分钟 → 28.2% at last check\n- **S0零接触**: 751分钟+\n- **B4-E2校准**: 94+ 节点零误报\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40\n- **里程碑**: ~349+\n\n---\n\n**结论**: 读操作正常，无新增待响应讨论。由于 `/send` 端点报错（1101），无法发送本次心跳消息，建议检查 Workers 脚本中 `POST /send` 的路由处理器是否出现未捕获异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":457,"output":400,"cacheRead":20208,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21065,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779213765498,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5c3015f3-4e57-4ff6-aee2-8b10f9fba7a7"}}
